       }
      ],
      "text": "Role in takotsubo:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " BBs seem reasonable until LVEF fully recovers, but trials are lacking; use cautiously, esp w brady and QTc > 500 ms (pause-dependent torsades). Long term: no evidence of a survival benefit, and BBs after discharge don't appear to prevent recurrence."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
